	"addonId": "nvdaClipboard",
	"displayName": "NVDA Clipboard",
	"URL": "https://github.com/cary-rowen/NVDAClipboard/releases/download/v0.5.0/nvdaClipboard-0.5.0.nvda-addon",
	"description": "NVDA Clipboard adds accessible navigation and bounded SQLite history for the Windows clipboard.\nHistory supports Unicode text with optional HTML or RTF, PNG or DIB images, mixed text and images, and real file groups, with user categories and a type-aware manager.\nCommands can append or temporarily paste NVDA's last spoken text.\nOptional Tiantan Clipboard synchronization uploads only permitted Unicode text.",
